        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the vested account balance of a participant who separates from service for any reason other than death is $5,000 or less, and such participant does not make a distribution election after the participant's off roll date, the participant's vested account balance will automatically be distributed in a lump sum in accordance with regulatory requirements. Accounts will be valued periodically for this purpose.",
